  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The motion of an object as it bounces off a sensor is recorded in the table below.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Measurement</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mass of object</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.40 \\mathrm{~kg}\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Velocity before impact</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+8.0 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Velocity after impact</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-6.0 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Duration of contact</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.040 \\mathrm{~s}\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the average net force acting on the object during the collision?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">20 N</li><li data-label=\"B\">60 N</li><li data-label=\"C\">80 N</li><li data-label=\"D\">140 N</li></ol>"
